       "off"
           Disabled

       Since: 2.2

       OnOffSplit (Enum)

       An enumeration of three values: on, off, and split

       Values:

       "on"
           Enabled

       "off"
           Disabled

       "split"
           Mixed

       Since: 2.6

       String (Object)

       A fat type wrapping 'str', to be embedded in lists.

       Members:

       "str: string"
           Not documented

       Since: 1.2

